    },
    {
      "id": "53dd8559b0c6",
      "text": "” 这句话刚出口，空气仿佛凝固了一瞬。",
      "status": "strengthened",
      "first_volume": null,
      "first_chapter": 2,
      "first_title": "不是普通旧案",
      "mentions": 2,
