        },
        {
          "volume": null,
          "chapter_no": 3,
          "title": "安全屋前厅显形",
          "event": "touch",
          "text": "” 空气仿佛在这一刻凝固成了冰。",
          "updated_at": "2026-05-09T06:21:22Z"
        }
